  <!-- OutDir=$(ProjectDir)..\build\ resolves to 3fp\kernel\build\, while
       FFF.Native.dll and the four FFmpeg DLLs live two levels up in 3fp\build\.
       Mirror the exe there so the launcher finds it next to the kernel DLL and
       the helper can resolve avformat-63.dll at load time. -->
